<title>NETHERLANDS: De Silguy says link agreed between pact and jobs.</title>
<headline>De Silguy says link agreed between pact and jobs.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Monetary Affairs Commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy said on Monday that an agreement reached by finance ministers on Monday would establish a link between the stability pact and jobs.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be a link between the stability pact and the growth and jobs pact,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
